# Menus answered by a letter or Esc inside a GOSUB routine, written by hand. Choosing a menu entry
# by its letter, or leaving with Esc, once left a GOSUB of menu pending, and the next RETURN
# stopped the game with "RETURN without GOSUB" (docs/devnotes.md, item 12). These steps once
# did that:
#   - Start Year: 1939 by its letter (filer's getyr);
#   - Editor, then No by its letter (yesno);
#   - Files, Quit, then Esc (yesno);
#   - Files, Load, then a saved game by its letter (filer's getsave).
# The other steps play the exits that item 12 rewrote: Esc at Start Year (getyr), Esc at Saved
# Games after Load and after Save (getsave), and F7 at the main menu (selex). The last step,
# Files, Quit, then Yes by its letter, ends the game.
#! seed 1939

# Waits that any key ends.
rule 1 key space

# The title menu: Start NEW Game. Esc at Start Year, then Start NEW Game again.
play until 2:W
text s
play until 2:S
digest
key esc
play until 2:W
digest
text s

# Start Year: 1939, by its letter.
play until 2:S
text 1

# Editor, the entry above Files (the last), then No by its letter.
play until 2:M
digest
key pagedown
prompt
key up
prompt
key enter
play until 2:Q
digest
text n

# Files, Quit, then Esc.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text q
play until 2:Q
key esc

# Files, Load, then Esc at Saved Games.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text l
play until 2:S
digest
key esc

# Files, Save, then Esc at Saved Games.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text s
play until 2:S
digest
key esc

# Files, Load, then the first saved game by its letter.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text l
play until 2:S
digest
text 1

# F7: the end of the turn.
play until 2:M
digest
key f7

# Files, Quit, then Yes by its letter, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text q
play until 2:Q
text y
repeat space
